ServiceNow MCP

The read-only server and Cowork tool contract derive from
https://github.com/likamrat/servicenow-cowork-plugin
at 0b6aa835259e505e34bf954682516c89d4ec2e44, itself a maintained adaptation of
https://github.com/fizamusthafa/servicenow-cowork-plugin at 05c37c3.
Both upstream copyright notices and the MIT permission notice are retained
in LICENSE.

The portable operator skills derive from the same maintained repository's
local authored candidate 54bdb474f07841fa1ffc664ab83da5cfa257ff1a.

The administrative adapters are maintained original operator code by
Lior Kamrat and contributors, extracted without private runtime bindings,
source snapshots or vendor implementation bodies. See docs/PROVENANCE.md.

ServiceNow, Microsoft and GitHub product names identify connected systems.
This project is not an official product of those companies. No vendor logos,
captured vendor implementation bodies, customer data or credentials are included.

Third-party packages retain their own licenses. Dependencies are restored
from the integrity-locked package-lock.json and are not vendored. Their
copyright and license notices remain in the installed packages and are
reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.
